This is the source code of status.rapidcow.org.
It is currently made public in the interest of showing
the inner workings of the status page.  You may study
the code and the structure, but do not re-publish or
archive the content verbatim.

The good stuff is tracked in the other two branches:
  pages       contains the raw content generated from pages-src
  pages-src   contains the code+data used to generate pages
This main branch only contains informative files, such as the
README you are currently reading.

This repository should not be archived and I do not hold any
responsibility for making this repository available on the Web.
